      "",
      "With water inside, spend one unit to drench",
      "yourself or an adjacent creature. This puts out",
      "current flames and leaves the target wet. Wetness",
      "helps resist heat ignition but strengthens a later",
      "electrical charge; it does not make fire attacks",
      "harmless. Soaking a non-burning outsider provokes",
